contribution of students’ prior learning towards their program requirements.</li><li>Credit may be granted for formal, informal, and non-formal learning.</li><li>Visit the Credit for previous study page for more information.</li><li>Answer a few simple questions with our online Credit Assessor to see what credit you could get.</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>',
