-- Course: Bachelor of Biotechnology (Honours) (103526B)
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p> The Bachelor of Biotechnology (Honours) is a four-year direct-entry program designed for high-achieving students aiming to excel in the biotechnology sector. </p><p>You must maintain a competitive GPA to be guaranteed entry into the Honours year. This program includes a significant research or industry-focused project. The degree integrates biology, engineering, and computer science, providing a comprehensive foundation in molecular biology, genetics, and bioprocess engineering. </p><p>Use advanced techniques such as gene editing and proteomics, and explore the ethical, environmental, and economic aspects of biotechnology. </p>',
